{"src":"ja","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":246900,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ja","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":10085.425015,"text":"ライオンは最も社交的な猫科の動物であり、プライドと呼ばれる大集団で生活しています"},{"kind":"text","t":10351.300301,"text":"Lions are the most social cats and live in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"audio","t":10409.03838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10414.72578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10420.564778,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10423.823982,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":18780.303442999997,"text":"中東の温暖な気候に暮らす人々にとって家屋はそれほど重要ではありませんでした"},{"kind":"text","t":19114.854674000002,"text":"For people living in the warm climate of the Middle East, houses were not that important."},{"kind":"audio","t":19161.601147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19166.461068999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19171.536128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19176.819563999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":19177.908138,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":30799.21987,"text":"ほとんどが砂浜で安全に泳ぐことができ、ポフツ川の木陰が日焼けになります。"},{"kind":"text","t":31323.286149,"text":"Most of it is a sandy beach where you can swim safely, and the shade of the trees along the Poftsu River protects you from sunburn."},{"kind":"audio","t":31385.704262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31391.066127,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31396.344743,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":31401.746717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31406.997153000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":31412.331298000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":31414.185192000004,"samples":15792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":42694.225437,"text":"プライドは、1から3頭の血縁関係にあるオスと、30頭余りのメスと子供たちで構成されます。"},{"kind":"text","t":43064.036563,"text":"A pride consists of 1 to 3 related males and over 30 females and cubs."},{"kind":"audio","t":43122.950475000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43128.254111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43133.358669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43138.670054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43141.237078,"samples":20128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":53240.656637,"text":"野生児は捨てられたり逃げ出したりする前に、柔道の時代虐待やトラウマを経験している可能性があります。"},{"kind":"text","t":53599.255710000005,"text":"Wild children may have experienced abuse or trauma during their early years before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"audio","t":53657.285185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53660.625398000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53663.846373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53667.005349,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":53670.435011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53673.869392,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":53674.229047,"samples":6192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66305.186407,"text":"新都内駅のスコッターバス403が定期的に運行しており カボダロカに停車します"},{"kind":"text","t":66710.649562,"text":"Shintounai Station's scooter bus 403 runs regularly and stops at Kabodaroka."},{"kind":"audio","t":66759.30246800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66764.744282,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66769.803661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66775.187405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66780.822606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":66780.98227400001,"samples":4760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":78211.089961,"text":"香港の最高の景色を見るには、島から出てクーロンのウォーターフロントに向かいましょう。"},{"kind":"text","t":78566.570308,"text":"To see the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head toward the Kowloon waterfront."},{"kind":"audio","t":78623.724795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78629.212918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":78634.212728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78639.491294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78643.04868400001,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":87105.21857,"text":"受け入れられたのは心理学を含む科学のあらゆる事項に関するアリストテレスの見解でした"},{"kind":"text","t":87428.909323,"text":"Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including psychology, were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":87485.144263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87490.519058,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87495.754844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87500.828523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87502.733726,"samples":16528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":101609.778713,"text":"オーストラリアのミッチェル・ゴーリーはスーパージー男子スタンディングで11位に終わりました。 チェコのオルドリッチ・エリネグは男子シングルスーパージーで16位に終わりました。"},{"kind":"text","t":102325.50316000001,"text":"Mitchell Gourley of Australia finished 11th in the men's super-G standing. Oldřich Eliáš of the Czech Republic finished 16th in the men's super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":102370.788434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102376.00795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102381.262266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102385.70768400001,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"audio","t":102417.711915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102422.965791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102428.283946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102432.769283,"samples":30696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":115330.09345100001,"text":"この都市はアフリカの都市というよりもアラビア色が強く 国内の他の都市とは対照的な雰囲気です"},{"kind":"text","t":115724.983275,"text":"This city feels more Arabian than African, and has an atmosphere that contrasts with other cities in the country."},{"kind":"audio","t":115781.393932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115783.351365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115785.051991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115787.01152300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115788.918267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115789.819224,"samples":23360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":129166.77665500001,"text":"革命後は職業も公募制になって男性全員に応募資格があり 最も意欲があって勝ち抜いた者が職に就けるようになりました"},{"kind":"text","t":129778.50377200001,"text":"After the revolution, jobs were filled through open recruitment, and all men were eligible to apply, allowing those who were most motivated and successful in the selection process to secure employment."},{"kind":"audio","t":129855.60392899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129860.809096,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129866.22682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129871.35897799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129876.843171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129882.035838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129887.19473599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129890.45782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129893.72680399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129897.213585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":129897.362923,"samples":5320,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":140753.93136699998,"text":"核爆弾は一つの原子核に多くの陽子と中性子を集めるには エネルギーが必要であるという原理で作用します"},{"kind":"text","t":141160.657144,"text":"Nuclear bombs operate on the principle that energy is required to gather many protons and neutrons into a single atomic nucleus."},{"kind":"audio","t":141214.83781199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141220.118188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141225.33200499997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141230.31586499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141235.69063899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141240.824807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141246.222942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":141246.547867,"samples":8224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":155861.704585,"text":"コ氏は削減する数値を定めませんでしたが、削減は中国の経済産出量に基づいて実施されるだろうと述べました。"},{"kind":"text","t":156346.320728,"text":"Mr. Ko did not specify the reduction figures, but stated that the reductions would likely be implemented based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"audio","t":156409.16787499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156414.490111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156419.434731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":156424.683288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156430.01833299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156435.25996899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":156440.561235,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":156440.91519,"samples":9424,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":170923.726497,"text":"骨董品について、普遍的な定義はありません。 税務署によっては、100年以上前のものを骨董品と定義しています。"},{"kind":"text","t":171339.29304999998,"text":"There is no universal definition of antiques. Some tax offices define items over 100 years old as antiques."},{"kind":"audio","t":171393.179193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171398.777435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171402.76024899998,"samples":28664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"audio","t":171461.515013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171466.990517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":171472.25570299997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171477.90926299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":171478.10196,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":177947.40621999998,"text":"軍島や湖では必ずしもヨットは必要ありません。"},{"kind":"text","t":178204.025975,"text":"Yachts are not necessarily required for the military islands or lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":178269.249239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178274.560924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178279.798991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":178283.99096199998,"samples":28296,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":186521.994687,"text":"そのためこの形式のアスペクト比12で割って最も単純な全数比を求めるは3対2と言われています"},{"kind":"text","t":187077.946398,"text":"Therefore, it is said that dividing this format's aspect ratio of 12 to find the simplest whole-number ratio results in 3:2."},{"kind":"audio","t":187141.89557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187147.394522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187152.71202799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187157.745897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187163.140711,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187168.25391899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187173.46844599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187174.46443199998,"samples":16624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":201211.97131499997,"text":"豪奢な一緒の中心としての名声は紀元400年頃から始まり紀元1100年頃まで続きました"},{"kind":"text","t":201646.77225699998,"text":"Its reputation as a luxurious center began around 400 AD and continued until around 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":201709.37161799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201714.813362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201719.99263899997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201725.29308399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":201730.661129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":201736.108863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201741.26486999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":201741.418468,"samples":6424,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":216000.430149,"text":"キャンセルポリシーは様々ですが、3月下旬の時点でほとんどのコロナウイルス関連のキャンセルポリシーはオリンピックを予定されていた2020年7月まで延長されません。"},{"kind":"text","t":216599.70520199998,"text":"Cancellation policies vary, but as of late March, most coronavirus-related cancellation policies will not be extended until July 2020, when the Olympics were scheduled."},{"kind":"audio","t":216665.14004199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216666.57656199997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216668.09841099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":216669.65907899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216671.295846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216672.888074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":216674.46248199997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216676.01716999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216677.727476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":216678.08134099998,"samples":10488,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":226404.270032,"text":"乾いた粉を2つ合わせてくるくるとこね回し、清潔な濡れた手でぎゅっと握ります。"},{"kind":"text","t":226845.580963,"text":"Combine the two dry powders, knead them together in a swirling motion, and squeeze firmly with clean, wet hands."},{"kind":"audio","t":226908.102445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226913.752976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226919.12230999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226924.33258699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226929.747981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226933.959132,"samples":28760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":239335.62709199998,"text":"サンクトペティルブルークのクルーズには、街での滞在時間が含まれています。 クルーズの"},{"kind":"text","t":239646.865531,"text":"The Saint Petersburg cruise includes time to spend in the city. The cruise's"},{"kind":"audio","t":239709.849826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":239711.580552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"aud